---
description: Cut AI tells from UI
alwaysApply: true
---

When building or editing UI, apply `~/.agents/skills/unslop-ui/SKILL.md`. Read that file. Do not skip it.

Hard rules even before the read:
- Use the repo's colors, type, and components. Do not invent a palette or a font.
- Do not restyle the app shell to look designed.
- No default layout from the training prior: no 3 equal icon cards, no centered full-viewport hero, no rainbow gradient.
- No fake browser, phone, or IDE chrome.
- No invented metrics, logos, avatars, or quotes.
- No italic headings. No gradient text as the brand.
- No decorative blobs, orbs, mesh gradients, or glass for its own sake.
- No `transition-all`. No `hover:scale-105` as the hover.
